    <main>
        <div id="smooth-wrapper">
            <div id="smooth-content">
                
            <section class="textCover textCover--sm">
            <div class="container text-center">
                <div data-aos="fade-up" class="subtitle">Since 1982</div>
                <h1 data-aos="fade-up" class="title title--big"><p>We Are Supreme Universal</p></h1>
            </div>
        </section>
    
                    <section class="aboutSec1">
                <div data-aos="fade-up" class="aboutSec1__container mx-auto">
                    <div class="swiper">
                        <div class="swiper-wrapper align-items-end">
                                                            <div class="swiper-slide">
                                    <img src="https://cdn.supremeuniversal.com/media/bt32Xz_MB1.jpg" alt="Supreme Universal">
                                </div>
                                                            <div class="swiper-slide">
                                    <img src="https://cdn.supremeuniversal.com/media/YaCqYb_MB2.jpg" alt="Supreme Universal">
                                </div>
                                                            <div class="swiper-slide">
                                    <img src="https://cdn.supremeuniversal.com/media/9MuqwO_MB3.jpg" alt="Supreme Universal">
                                </div>
                                                            <div class="swiper-slide">
                                    <img src="https://cdn.supremeuniversal.com/media/I5yPZc_MB4.jpg" alt="Supreme Universal">
                                </div>
                                                            <div class="swiper-slide">
                                    <img src="https://cdn.supremeuniversal.com/media/HcshOM_MB5a.jpg" alt="Supreme Universal">
                                </div>
                                                    </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
        
    
            <section class="aboutSec2 paddingTop">
            <div data-aos="fade-up" class="container text-center">
                <img data-aos="fade-up" class="mx-auto mb-3 aboutSec2__moon" src="https://www.supremeuniversal.com/front/img/icons/logo-moon.svg" alt="Supreme Universal">
                <div data-aos="fade-up" class="subtitle">About Us</div>
                <h2 data-aos="fade-up" class="title">Small Details are a Big Deal to Us</h2>
                <div data-aos="fade-up" class="secDesc text-start mt-5 pt-sm-2">
                    <p>Since 1982, Supreme Universal has been shaping the skylines of Mumbai and Pune with thoughtfully designed spaces that enrich lives. Over four decades, we’ve delivered 81 landmarks and 40+ redevelopment projects, driven by an unwavering commitment to quality, transparency, strong relationships, and elegant design.</p><p>Our legacy is built not just on structures but on creating meaningful living experiences. By studying global benchmarks, we’ve refined our core philosophy - elevating lifestyles through the built form and the surrounding ecosystem. This vision ensures that every project is more than a home - a holistic, life-enhancing environment.</p><p>We remain deeply attuned to the evolving needs of our customers, approaching each market with clarity and insight. Guided by experience and innovation, we collaborate with top designers, engineers, and industry leaders to anticipate challenges and craft forward-thinking solutions. Supreme Universal continues to lead change by combining design excellence with a human-centric approach to real estate.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        
        
        <section class="projInenrSec7 paddingTopBottom-lg">
            <div class="container py-4">
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-md-7 offset-md-3">
                        <div class="d-inline-block">
                            <div class="subtitle text-center">Our Redevelopment</div>
                            <h2 class="title">Design Philosophy</h2>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mt-4">
                            <p>At Supreme Universal, every redevelopment project is thoughtfully crafted around core design principles designed to enhance community living and individual experiences.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                
                    <div class="imageChangingAccordion row mt-5 pt-sm-3">
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <div class="accordion accordion-flush" id="accordionTwo">
                                                                    <div data-aos="fade-up" class="accordion-item active">
                                        <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                            <button class="accordion-button show" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#wkyY5K" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="flush-pCvv1u">
                                                <span>01 Maximized Ventilation & Natural Light</span>
                                            </button>
                                        </h2>
                                        <div id="wkyY5K" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#accordionTwo">
                                            <div class="accordion-body">Our spaces are designed to breathe, with layouts prioritizing optimal air circulation and abundant natural light, fostering healthier and more enjoyable homes.</div>
                                            <img class="w-100 ps-sm-2 d-sm-none" src="https://cdn.supremeuniversal.com/media/aWzlCZ_About-Us-Overview--Maximised-Ventilation.jpg" alt="01 Maximized Ventilation & Natural Light">
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                                                    <div data-aos="fade-up" class="accordion-item ">
                                        <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                            <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#GSduPq" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="flush-pCvv1u">
                                                <span>02 Common Amenities</span>
                                            </button>
                                        </h2>
                                        <div id="GSduPq" class="accordion-collapse collapse " data-bs-parent="#accordionTwo">
                                            <div class="accordion-body">We create spacious communal areas thoughtfully designed to promote community interaction, leisure, and lasting connections among residents.</div>
                                            <img class="w-100 ps-sm-2 d-sm-none" src="https://cdn.supremeuniversal.com/media/MPsffP_DP-Common-Amenitiesmin.jpg" alt="02 Common Amenities">
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                                                    <div data-aos="fade-up" class="accordion-item ">
                                        <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                            <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#fyG8Ij" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="flush-pCvv1u">
                                                <span>03 Enhanced Podium & Green Spaces</span>
                                            </button>
                                        </h2>
                                        <div id="fyG8Ij" class="accordion-collapse collapse " data-bs-parent="#accordionTwo">
                                            <div class="accordion-body">Our developments integrate lush, carefully planned green environments and podium amenities, offering refreshing, serene outdoor spaces within urban living.</div>
                                            <img class="w-100 ps-sm-2 d-sm-none" src="https://cdn.supremeuniversal.com/media/gUEP4L_DP--enhanced-podium-and-green-spaces.jpg" alt="03 Enhanced Podium & Green Spaces">
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                                                    <div data-aos="fade-up" class="accordion-item ">
                                        <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                            <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#lfs1tU" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="flush-pCvv1u">
                                                <span>04 Elevated Rooftop Experiences</span>
                                            </button>
                                        </h2>
                                        <div id="lfs1tU" class="accordion-collapse collapse " data-bs-parent="#accordionTwo">
                                            <div class="accordion-body">Thoughtfully planned terraces provide spaces for meaningful rooftop amenities, offering residents peaceful retreats and captivating city views.</div>
                                            <img class="w-100 ps-sm-2 d-sm-none" src="https://cdn.supremeuniversal.com/media/sUvXeA_Amenities_880-X-900_Tower-16.jpg" alt="04 Elevated Rooftop Experiences">
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                                                    <div data-aos="fade-up" class="accordion-item ">
                                        <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                            <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#TK2Gbx" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="flush-pCvv1u">
                                                <span>05 Thoughtful Density Management</span>
                                            </button>
                                        </h2>
                                        <div id="TK2Gbx" class="accordion-collapse collapse " data-bs-parent="#accordionTwo">
                                            <div class="accordion-body">We consciously design buildings to maintain lower density, enhancing privacy, tranquility, and overall resident comfort.</div>
                                            <img class="w-100 ps-sm-2 d-sm-none" src="https://cdn.supremeuniversal.com/media/xQ03qp_About-us--Density-Managment.jpg" alt="05 Thoughtful Density Management">
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                                                
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div data-aos="fade-up" class="col-md-6">
                            <div class="imageChangingAccordion__imgs">
                                <div>
                                                                            <img class="media w-100 ps-sm-2" src="https://cdn.supremeuniversal.com/media/aWzlCZ_About-Us-Overview--Maximised-Ventilation.jpg" alt="01 Maximized Ventilation & Natural Light">
                                                                            <img class="media w-100 ps-sm-2" src="https://cdn.supremeuniversal.com/media/MPsffP_DP-Common-Amenitiesmin.jpg" alt="02 Common Amenities">
                                                                            <img class="media w-100 ps-sm-2" src="https://cdn.supremeuniversal.com/media/gUEP4L_DP--enhanced-podium-and-green-spaces.jpg" alt="03 Enhanced Podium & Green Spaces">
                                                                            <img class="media w-100 ps-sm-2" src="https://cdn.supremeuniversal.com/media/sUvXeA_Amenities_880-X-900_Tower-16.jpg" alt="04 Elevated Rooftop Experiences">
                                                                            <img class="media w-100 ps-sm-2" src="https://cdn.supremeuniversal.com/media/xQ03qp_About-us--Density-Managment.jpg" alt="05 Thoughtful Density Management">
                                                                    </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                
                <div class="mt-5 text-center">
                    <p>At Supreme Universal, purposeful design and meticulous attention to detail drive everything we create, reflecting our commitment to building spaces that genuinely enrich the lives of those who live in them.</p>
                </div>
                
            </div>
        </section>
        
        
    
            <section class="aboutSec3 bg-light paddingTopBottom-lg">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="text-center">
                    <div data-aos="fade-up" class="subtitle">Our Guiding Principles</div>
                    <h2 data-aos="fade-up" class="title">Design, Integrity and Innovation at Every Step </h2>
                </div>
                
                <div class="row gx-5">
                                                                                                <div data-aos="fade-up" class="col-md-6 mt-5 pt-sm-4 h-100">
                                <h5 class="mb-3 canelaRegular">Design begins at the drawing board</h5>
                                <div class="secDesc fs-6"><p><span style="font-size: 1rem;">We believe a project can truly be extraordinary with a detail-oriented mindset explored from the very outset. Every space we create is a meticulous symphony of design and functionality, ensuring that every detail enhances experiences.&nbsp;</span></p></div>
                            </div>
                                                                                                                        <div data-aos="fade-up" class="col-md-6 mt-5 pt-sm-4 h-100">
                                <h5 class="mb-3 canelaRegular">Principles over Profits</h5>
                                <div class="secDesc fs-6"><p><span style="font-size: 1rem;">At Supreme, trust isn’t just a promise, it’s a legacy. With quick approvals, seamless redevelopment, and transparency at every step, we ensure every homebuyer’s journey is secure, and hassle-free.</span></p></div>
                            </div>
                                                                                                                        <div data-aos="fade-up" class="col-md-6 mt-5 pt-sm-4 h-100">
                                <h5 class="mb-3 canelaRegular">Open Minds and Open Hearts</h5>
                                <div class="secDesc fs-6"><p><span style="font-size: 1rem;">We believe in elevating lifestyles by collaborating with the brightest minds in design, architecture, and craftsmanship. Together, we create spaces that inspire.</span></p></div>
                            </div>
                                                                                                                        <div data-aos="fade-up" class="col-md-6 mt-5 pt-sm-4 h-100">
                                <h5 class="mb-3 canelaRegular">Keeping it Real. Keeping it Right.</h5>
                                <div class="secDesc fs-6"><p><span style="font-size: 1rem;">The intent to create and nurture goodwill and relationships doesn’t come secondary to us, it is rather our standard. From assembling materials to the craftsmanship that put it together, we uphold the highest benchmarks, ensuring that every creation is nothing short of extraordinary.&nbsp;</span></p></div>
                            </div>
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        
            <section class="projInenrSec7 projInenrSec7--leftImgs paddingTopBottom">
            <div class="container py-sm-4">
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-md-7">
                        <div class="d-inline-block">
                            <div data-aos="fade-up" class="subtitle text-center">Our Core Values</div>
                            <h2 data-aos="fade-up" class="title">A Legacy Built on Timeless Values</h2>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
                            <div class="imageChangingAccordion row flex-row-reverse mt-5 pt-sm-3 px-3 px-sm-0">
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="accordion accordion-flush" id="accordionOne">
                                                            <div data-aos="fade-up" class="accordion-item active">
                                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                        <button class="accordion-button show" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#dlFjh4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="dlFjh4">
                                            <span>Collaboration</span>
                                        </button>
                                    </h2>
                                    <div id="dlFjh4" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#accordionOne">
                                        <div class="accordion-body"></p>The best ideas are built together. Whether it’s working with partners, customers, or teams, collaboration drives us to create spaces that truly elevate lifestyles.</p></div>
                                        <img class="w-100 pe-sm-5 mb-4 d-sm-none" src="https://cdn.supremeuniversal.com/media/5Lxg8h_CHIIP-Collaboration-1min.jpg" alt="Collaboration">
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                                            <div data-aos="fade-up" class="accordion-item ">
                                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#426K4C" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="426K4C">
                                            <span>Humility</span>
                                        </button>
                                    </h2>
                                    <div id="426K4C" class="accordion-collapse collapse " data-bs-parent="#accordionOne">
                                        <div class="accordion-body"></p>No matter how much we achieve, we stay grounded. Every project is an opportunity to listen, learn, and grow—ensuring we keep raising the bar while staying true to our roots.</p></div>
                                        <img class="w-100 pe-sm-5 mb-4 d-sm-none" src="https://cdn.supremeuniversal.com/media/2yFFfx_CHIIPHumilitymin.jpg" alt="Humility">
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                                            <div data-aos="fade-up" class="accordion-item ">
                                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#BwB4pE" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="BwB4pE">
                                            <span>Innovation</span>
                                        </button>
                                    </h2>
                                    <div id="BwB4pE" class="accordion-collapse collapse " data-bs-parent="#accordionOne">
                                        <div class="accordion-body"><p>We push boundaries to create better living experiences. Through purposeful design, superior materials, and well-planned spaces, we craft homes that stand the test of time. Constantly evolving with feedback, we ensure our innovations truly serve those who live in them.</p></div>
                                        <img class="w-100 pe-sm-5 mb-4 d-sm-none" src="https://cdn.supremeuniversal.com/media/SmoXuu_CHIIPInnovation-2min.jpg" alt="Innovation">
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                                            <div data-aos="fade-up" class="accordion-item ">
                                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#87NNdp" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="87NNdp">
                                            <span>Integrity</span>
                                        </button>
                                    </h2>
                                    <div id="87NNdp" class="accordion-collapse collapse " data-bs-parent="#accordionOne">
                                        <div class="accordion-body"></p> Trust is our foundation. Through transparency, commitment, and doing what’s right—always—we build lasting relationships, just like the spaces we create.</p></div>
                                        <img class="w-100 pe-sm-5 mb-4 d-sm-none" src="https://cdn.supremeuniversal.com/media/7b7V16_CHIIPIntegritymin.jpg" alt="Integrity">
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                                            <div data-aos="fade-up" class="accordion-item ">
                                    <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#VHthje" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="VHthje">
                                            <span>Persistence</span>
                                        </button>
                                    </h2>
                                    <div id="VHthje" class="accordion-collapse collapse " data-bs-parent="#accordionOne">
                                        <div class="accordion-body"></p>Excellence takes time, effort, and resilience. We don’t stop at challenges—we find solutions, refine ideas, and keep moving forward until we create something truly remarkable.</p></div>
                                        <img class="w-100 pe-sm-5 mb-4 d-sm-none" src="https://cdn.supremeuniversal.com/media/E8GL0X_CHIIPPersistencemin.jpg" alt="Persistence">
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div data-aos="fade-up" class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="imageChangingAccordion__imgs">
