            <section class="aboutSec4 paddingTopBottom-lg">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-md-7">
                        <div class="d-inline-block">
                            <div data-aos="fade-up" class="subtitle text-center">Our Visionaries</div>
                            <h2 data-aos="fade-up" class="title">A Team Committed to Shaping the Future of Living</h2>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                                    <div class="row">
                                                    <div data-aos="fade-up" class="col-md-3 mt-5">
                                <div class="aboutSec4__box pointer" data-cursor="read more" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#teamModal_QPHCdW">
                                    <img class="w-100" src="https://cdn.supremeuniversal.com/media/PJdnjr_ramesh.jpg" alt="Mr. Ramesh Bijlani">
                                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between gap-2">
                                        <h4 class="my-3">Mr. Ramesh Bijlani</h4>
                                        <div class="lineBtn lineBtn--noArrow d-sm-none canelaLight">read more</div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="atlasRegular fs-6">Founder and Chairman</div>
                                    <div class="line-clamp line-clamp-2 pt-3 fs-6"><p>It’s a significant responsibility to help people realise their dreams and aspirations. Using design, we have elevated the quality of our customers' lives as a whole.</p><p>He has been instrumental in establishing clear objectives for the company. For him, innovation and design converge to transform real estate into a catalyst for elevating the quality of life, not just through luxury, but through meaningful experiences. His vision continues to steer the company in creating enduring spaces that stand the test of time.</p></div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                                                    <div data-aos="fade-up" class="col-md-3 mt-5">
                                <div class="aboutSec4__box pointer" data-cursor="read more" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#teamModal_YsThMB">
                                    <img class="w-100" src="https://cdn.supremeuniversal.com/media/TFDg2I_suresh.jpg" alt="Mr. Suresh Jumani">
                                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between gap-2">
                                        <h4 class="my-3">Mr. Suresh Jumani</h4>
                                        <div class="lineBtn lineBtn--noArrow d-sm-none canelaLight">read more</div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="atlasRegular fs-6">Founder and Chairman</div>
                                    <div class="line-clamp line-clamp-2 pt-3 fs-6"><p>Transparency goes beyond honesty - it’s about clarity. Our values ensure customers know exactly what is happening at each step and feel confident through the journey.</p><p>His dedication to honesty and open communication has shaped the culture at Supreme Universal, making the experience seamless and empowering for the company and customers alike. His beliefs still contribute to accelerating the brand’s journey towards success.</p></div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                                                    <div data-aos="fade-up" class="col-md-3 mt-5">
                                <div class="aboutSec4__box pointer" data-cursor="read more" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#teamModal_ymPu5O">
                                    <img class="w-100" src="https://cdn.supremeuniversal.com/media/TEdqI9_Sunny-Bijlani.jpg" alt="Mr. Sunny Bijlani">
                                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between gap-2">
                                        <h4 class="my-3">Mr. Sunny Bijlani</h4>
                                        <div class="lineBtn lineBtn--noArrow d-sm-none canelaLight">read more</div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="atlasRegular fs-6">Joint Managing Director</div>
                                    <div class="line-clamp line-clamp-2 pt-3 fs-6"><p>Creating homes for customers isn’t something we take lightly; it requires careful thought and consideration. Numbers are long forgotten, only relationships and experiences remain.</p><p>A leader with sharp business acumen and foresight, Sunny’s approach to business is deeply rooted in integrity and ethical practices. He understands that the true success parameter of the company is the trust and confidence bestowed upon by customers.&nbsp;</p></div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                                                    <div data-aos="fade-up" class="col-md-3 mt-5">
                                <div class="aboutSec4__box pointer" data-cursor="read more" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#teamModal_cwSWYj">
                                    <img class="w-100" src="https://cdn.supremeuniversal.com/media/qBjlMu_Vishal-Jumani-1.jpg" alt="Mr. Vishal Jumani">
                                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between gap-2">
                                        <h4 class="my-3">Mr. Vishal Jumani</h4>
                                        <div class="lineBtn lineBtn--noArrow d-sm-none canelaLight">read more</div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="atlasRegular fs-6">Joint Managing Director</div>
                                    <div class="line-clamp line-clamp-2 pt-3 fs-6"><p>There’s no set formula for great design. We dive in headfirst and evolve as we go. We lean on the collective creativity and energy of the team to achieve our goals.</p><p>Vishal’s passion for modern design and knack for innovative concepts have been pivotal in shaping the company’s portfolio of iconic projects. He understands the importance of balancing design and functionality and ensures that every development reflects the highest standards of design excellence.</p></div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                                            </div>
                            </div>
        </section>
    
    
