                                <h4 class="mt-3 pb-2">Mr. Ramesh Bijlani</h4>
                                <div class="h6">Founder and Chairman</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-7 mt-4 mt-sm-0">
                                <div class="secDesc fs-6">
                                    <p>It’s a significant responsibility to help people realise their dreams and aspirations. Using design, we have elevated the quality of our customers' lives as a whole.</p><p>He has been instrumental in establishing clear objectives for the company. For him, innovation and design converge to transform real estate into a catalyst for elevating the quality of life, not just through luxury, but through meaningful experiences. His vision continues to steer the company in creating enduring spaces that stand the test of time.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
            <div class="modal fade teamModal" id="teamModal_YsThMB" tabindex="-1">
            <div class="modal-dialog modal-lg">
                <div class="modal-content">
                    <div class="modal-header">
                        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="modal-body">
                        <div class="row gx-5">
                            <div class="col-md-5">
                                <img class="w-100" src="https://cdn.supremeuniversal.com/media/TFDg2I_suresh.jpg" alt="Mr. Suresh Jumani">
                                <h4 class="mt-3 pb-2">Mr. Suresh Jumani</h4>
                                <div class="h6">Founder and Chairman</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-7 mt-4 mt-sm-0">
                                <div class="secDesc fs-6">
                                    <p>Transparency goes beyond honesty - it’s about clarity. Our values ensure customers know exactly what is happening at each step and feel confident through the journey.</p><p>His dedication to honesty and open communication has shaped the culture at Supreme Universal, making the experience seamless and empowering for the company and customers alike. His beliefs still contribute to accelerating the brand’s journey towards success.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
            <div class="modal fade teamModal" id="teamModal_ymPu5O" tabindex="-1">
            <div class="modal-dialog modal-lg">
                <div class="modal-content">
                    <div class="modal-header">
                        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="modal-body">
                        <div class="row gx-5">
                            <div class="col-md-5">
                                <img class="w-100" src="https://cdn.supremeuniversal.com/media/TEdqI9_Sunny-Bijlani.jpg" alt="Mr. Sunny Bijlani">
                                <h4 class="mt-3 pb-2">Mr. Sunny Bijlani</h4>
                                <div class="h6">Joint Managing Director</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-7 mt-4 mt-sm-0">
                                <div class="secDesc fs-6">
                                    <p>Creating homes for customers isn’t something we take lightly; it requires careful thought and consideration. Numbers are long forgotten, only relationships and experiences remain.</p><p>A leader with sharp business acumen and foresight, Sunny’s approach to business is deeply rooted in integrity and ethical practices. He understands that the true success parameter of the company is the trust and confidence bestowed upon by customers.&nbsp;</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
