                        <p>Please ensure that you deal with only RERA registered real estate agents (“Registered Real Estate Agents”) whose name appear as a real estate agent under the project name on the RERA web site. If you have received any unsolicited calls or text messages in breach of the regulatory norms or from agents not registered with us, please report such instances to us on <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#4c25222a230c3f393c3e2921293922253a293e3f2d20622f2321"><u><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="4e272028210e3d3b3e3c2b232b3b2027382b3c3d2f22602d2123">[email&#160;protected]</span></u></a> for our further investigation and action.</p>
